cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Portfolio, by Hemrock"
abstract: >-
  Open-source software for venture funds in four areas: portfolio reporting built from founder
  updates, an investment workflow from inbound screening through diligence and memos, LP reporting
  with statements, letters and a portal, and fund operations on double-entry books for every
  entity. An MCP server lets Claude, ChatGPT and other agents work with a fund's own data.
  Self-hosted on Supabase and Vercel or Netlify.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Taylor
    family-names: Davidson
    affiliation: Hemrock
repository-code: "https://github.com/tdavidson/portfolio"
url: "https://www.hemrock.com/portfolio"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
